# Flux source-controller artifact exclusions.
#
# This file REPLACES source-controller's default exclusion list. The defaults
# strip image files (jpg/png/...) from the artifact, which breaks
# configMapGenerator file sources like homepage's background.jpg. Everything
# below mirrors the flux defaults EXCEPT the image suffixes we need — do not
# trim entries from this list without checking what flux excludes by default
# (notably .sops.yaml: letting it through breaks any kustomization that
# directory-scans clusters/*, e.g. flux-system on the data cluster).
.git/
.gitignore
.gitmodules
.gitattributes
*.wmv
*.flv
*.tar.gz
*.zip
.github/
.circleci/
.travis.yml
.gitlab-ci.yml
appveyor.yml
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
codefresh.yml
.sops.yaml
.flux.yaml
# repo housekeeping (not needed in the artifact)
.vscode/
docs/
Plans/
scripts/
graphify-out/
*.md
/gitops-workflow.png
/homelab-architecture.png
